# Venser, Fervent Forger: "Create two tokens that are copies of target permanent an opponent controls. They gain haste. At
# the beginning of the next end step, sacrifice them." Bot2 has a Forest and a Llanowar Elves, so the choice of target is
# asked: Venser's own controller's Mox Pearl is not one of the answers (it is not an opponent's permanent), the Elves is.
# The two 1/1 Elf Druid tokens arrive under Bot1 with haste, and the delayed ability of Venser's own card sacrifices both
# at the end step of this turn: they cease to exist, so they are in no graveyard (Bot1's Graveyard is only the Black Lotus).

